    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u231b<u>Summary:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Fate in Viking Saga \u2014 Text\u2011Driven RPG, Legacy Permadeath, Deep Choices</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Legacy Permadeath &amp; Progression</strong> \u2013 Every death counts. Earn points, grow stronger across runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd04 Multiple Story Paths</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape each adventure and unlock new outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Turn\u2011Based Viking Combat</strong> \u2013 Survive by any means necessary or enter Valhalla.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f Town Life\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Work, rest, train, trade\u00a0\u2013 build your legacy.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcdc Rich Narrative</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in medieval Norse lore and tough moral dilemmas.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded<u>Choices That Direct Your Path:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shall face many difficult choices. The outcome will depend on your character - a clumsy strong warrior might have a hard time choosing a stealthy approach etc. Some results of your choices may have far reaching consequences while others could be of little importance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 <u>Death Is Just a Beginning</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is permanent, you'll have to start over. Don't worry though because for every death you earn legacy points   to empower your next character making him much stronger than his predecessors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u267e\ufe0f <u>Designed for Multiple Playthroughs:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be played multiple times. Experiment with various choices, experience different outcomes and discover new story branches.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd14 <u>Demo:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure if this is your kind of adventure? Download the demo and step into the world of <i>Valhalla Awaits</i> for free.<br>If you like it, don't forget to wishlist!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u231b<u>Summary:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Fate in Viking Saga \u2014 Text\u2011Driven RPG, Legacy Permadeath, Deep Choices</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Legacy Permadeath &amp; Progression</strong> \u2013 Every death counts. Earn points, grow stronger across runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd04 Multiple Story Paths</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape each adventure and unlock new outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Turn\u2011Based Viking Combat</strong> \u2013 Survive by any means necessary or enter Valhalla.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f Town Life\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Work, rest, train, trade\u00a0\u2013 build your legacy.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcdc Rich Narrative</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in medieval Norse lore and tough moral dilemmas.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded<u>Choices That Direct Your Path:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shall face many difficult choices. The outcome will depend on your character - a clumsy strong warrior might have a hard time choosing a stealthy approach etc. Some results of your choices may have far reaching consequences while others could be of little importance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 <u>Death Is Just a Beginning</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is permanent, you'll have to start over. Don't worry though because for every death you earn legacy points   to empower your next character making him much stronger than his predecessors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u267e\ufe0f <u>Designed for Multiple Playthroughs:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be played multiple times. Experiment with various choices, experience different outcomes and discover new story branches.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd14 <u>Demo:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure if this is your kind of adventure? Download the demo and step into the world of <i>Valhalla Awaits</i> for free.<br>If you like it, don't forget to wishlist!</p>",
    "short_description": "Violence spreads across Europe as Viking raids intensify. In this choice-driven RPG, your fate is shaped by hard decisions, brutal turn-based combat, and a legacy system where death is permanent\u2014but not the end. Live, die, and fight again. Valhalla awaits.",
